Note: Phase 36 Plan 36-08 — GEN-03 cellular automata primitives (D-36-08).
Note: 1D `cellular` uses the Wolfram-convention single-1-center default seed
Note: pattern; the seed arg is accepted for signature uniformity but ignored.
Note: `cellularSeeded` accepts an explicit Array[Bool] initial pattern.
Note: 2D `life` uses a composer-supplied seed to seed a Random for 30%-density
Note: initial fill. Both 1D and 2D primitives clamp width/height/steps to
Note: <= 1024 (T-36-19 DoS guard) and wrap rule values via & 0xFF.
